
Auth
* user registers
* user selects role (student or tutor)
* user submits information related to their roles
* 

Student Flow 

* student logins 
* checks for scheduled classes 
* click on a google meet pseudo link
* this triggers the system to log attendance(student clicked that link therefore, they started the class)
* after they leave the meeting, the system logs the time of leaving (because it is connected to google meet api)
* an email is sent to the student to log their progress (has to be very short).


Tutor 

* Tutor logins 
* Checks for scheduled classes 
* Clicks on the pseudo link 
* this activates the pseudo link for the student
* after the meeting, the pseudo link deactivates 
* the tutor is sent an email to verify the students attendace and log their performance 
* so both tutors and students will edit the session 
* 


